E"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":1104106,"initDialog":110410601,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1018],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Albedo1_11041/Q1104106","priority":0,"questId":11041,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":110410601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":581682890,"text":"Who are you? Why did you alarm them?","nextNodeIds":[110410602]},{"nodeId":110410602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":58829138,"text":"Thank the gods I'd already completed my painting. Would've been a shame to leave these particular hilichurls unfinished.","nextNodeIds":[110410603,110410604]},{"nodeId":110410603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3364341346,"text":"You were painting hilichurls?","nextNodeIds":[110410605]},{"nodeId":110410605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4137747610,"text":"What's up with painting hilichurls? What makes them so interesting?","nextNodeIds":[110410606]},{"nodeId":110410606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":4189669730,"text":"Hmm, I'm afraid the answer isn't easy to explain. If you'd like to have a look at my painting, it may give you a clue.","nextNodeIds":[110410607,110410608]},{"nodeId":110410607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2555646282,"text":"Uh...","nextNodeIds":[110410609]},{"nodeId":110410609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1389888954,"text":"Wow, look at the detail! But some of it seems to have been done in a hurry.","nextNodeIds":[110410610]},{"nodeId":110410610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":656028506,"text":"You can find these hilichurls anywhere, quite boring in fact, not worth closer inspection.","nextNodeIds":[110410611]},{"nodeId":110410611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":190621610,"text":"But take a look at this specimen. The build, the coat... And there's a distinct force at work here.","nextNodeIds":[110410612]},{"nodeId":110410612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":1972157538,"text":"In the cyclical lives of such primitive communities, such unique attributes are an indication of evolution at work. Evolution, the transition from nothing into existence, from the known to the un—","nextNodeIds":[110410613]},{"nodeId":110410613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"Rosaria","textMapHash":1737632850,"text":"Hold your horses. Ugh, something tells me we're in for a thesis, and I haven't got the stamina.","nextNodeIds":[110410614]},{"nodeId":110410614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"Rosaria","textMapHash":2959014186,"text":"We've found your man, I'm headed back.","nextNodeIds":[110410615]},{"nodeId":110410615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3903393994,"text":"What!? Don't you have any questions for him? Hey!","nextNodeIds":[110410616]},{"nodeId":110410616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":232324146,"text":"Ugh, what a weirdo.","nextNodeIds":[110410617]},{"nodeId":110410617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3832202074,"text":"So Sister Rosaria brought you? Surprising. And I didn't have time to thank her.","nextNodeIds":[110410618]},{"nodeId":110410618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3894995986,"text":"But back to the point. From her words, it seems that you were looking for me?","nextNodeIds":[110410619]},{"nodeId":110410619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1580141858,"text":"Mm-hmm, we met a girl in Mondstadt, Sucrose! She said you were stuck with your research.","nextNodeIds":[110410620]},{"nodeId":110410620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":456148906,"text":"I see, so Sucrose sent you here.","nextNodeIds":[110410621]},{"nodeId":110410621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3690000946,"text":"Then, if I'm not mistaken, you must be the Honorary Knight. You've got the whole of Mondstadt talking.","nextNodeIds":[110410622]},{"nodeId":110410622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3606848698,"text":"I've heard a bit of everything: your actions during Stormterror's attack, your elemental control, and quite a few other mysterious things...","nextNodeIds":[110410623]},{"nodeId":110410623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":145407938,"text":"I'll skip to the conclusion, there's only one possibility after all. You came from afar — from another world. Correct?","nextNodeIds":[110410624,110410625]},{"nodeId":110410624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3681839050,"text":"Correct.","nextNodeIds":[110410626]},{"nodeId":110410626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3329350482,"text":"Excellent. If I could procure your assistance, I think my research would benefit enormously.","nextNodeIds":[110410627,110410628]},{"nodeId":110410627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":207187074,"text":"Your research?","nextNodeIds":[110410629]},{"nodeId":110410629,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3240473698,"text":"Ah — forgive me, this must be confusing. Where should I begin? Hmm... The essence of life?","nextNodeIds":[110410630]},{"nodeId":110410630,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":304550714,"text":"Whoa whoa, you want to start with that!?","nextNodeIds":[110410631]},{"nodeId":110410631,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3698609626,"text":"Hmm... You're right. Giving a demonstration would be better than trying to explain.","nextNodeIds":[110410632]},{"nodeId":110410632,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":349625850,"text":"For example, awakening life. Breathing new life into fallen leaves.","nextNodeIds":[110410634]},{"nodeId":110410634,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1886531490,"text":"You can do that!?","nextNodeIds":[110410635,110410636]},{"nodeId":110410635,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2020812930,"text":"Alchemy really is miraculous.","nextNodeIds":[110410637]},{"nodeId":110410637,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":1441439202,"text":"However, I have a particular seed in my possession. The method I'm talking about has produced no results.","nextNodeIds":[110410639]},{"nodeId":110410639,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":1429735786,"text":"It's like you, in that it hails from another world. Helping it to grow — to bloom... That's the problem my research is up against. That's where I'd need your assistance.","nextNodeIds":[110410640]},{"nodeId":110410640,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2046558874,"text":"Well, if you're struggling to figure it out, Paimon's not sure we're gonna be much assistance.","nextNodeIds":[110410641]},{"nodeId":110410641,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3262349434,"text":"I beg to differ. I'm unable to comprehend the intricacies of life outside of the known world.","nextNodeIds":[110410642]},{"nodeId":110410642,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":4263306954,"text":"But you're not from the known world. By observing and researching you, I may just be able to find a way to get the seed to sprout.","nextNodeIds":[110410643]},{"nodeId":110410643,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2447185026,"text":"So I'm an... object of research?","nextNodeIds":[110410644]},{"nodeId":110410644,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":33789818,"text":"#Uh... Shall we just get outta here, {NICKNAME}? This sounds a little freaky.","nextNodeIds":[110410645,110410647]},{"nodeId":110410645,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2299616890,"text":"Is there any danger?","nextNodeIds":[110410646]},{"nodeId":110410646,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3265543106,"text":"It's possible. But I will do everything in my control to ensure your safety.","nextNodeIds":[110410649]},{"nodeId":110410649,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":3340632266,"text":"Time for a change of surroundings, we should be going. There's research to do!","nextNodeIds":[110410650]},{"nodeId":110410650,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"Rosaria","textMapHash":1779528594,"text":"","nextNodeIds":[110410651]},{"nodeId":110410651,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"Rosaria","textMapHash":924275778,"text":"Albedo and that Traveler seem to have hit it off.","nextNodeIds":[110410652]},{"nodeId":110410652,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"Rosaria","textMapHash":122578330,"text":"Takes a weirdo to know one I guess. I wonder... Does this constitute a risk to Mondstadt?","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110410647,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2329968762,"text":"What's in it for me?","nextNodeIds":[110410648]},{"nodeId":110410648,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1018,"speakerName":"Albedo","textMapHash":2556829402,"text":"Mora, knowledge. And the answer to the question you are seeking. It happens to be an answer that I can provide. How does that sound?","nextNodeIds":[110410649]},{"nodeId":110410636,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2270428362,"text":"Alchemy really is useful.","nextNodeIds":[110410637]},{"nodeId":110410628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3870329682,"text":"I'm not sure I understand.","nextNodeIds":[110410629]},{"nodeId":110410625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3983632858,"text":"You are worthy of your scholarly reputation.","nextNodeIds":[110410626]},{"nodeId":110410608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1538619954,"text":"Very... avant-garde.","nextNodeIds":[110410609]},{"nodeId":110410604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4228794186,"text":"I thought you were painting a landscape.","nextNodeIds":[110410605]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1104106,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1018"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[1104104,1104106],"speakerCounts":[{"roleTy